# odoo-fast-report-mapper | python/uv
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
▸ Setup:    uv venv && venv+ && uv pip install -e ".[dev]"
▸ Run:      odoo-fr-mapper --yaml_path=./yaml_examples/reports_yaml
▸ Select:   odoo-fr-mapper --yaml_path=./yaml --select
▸ Test:     python -m pytest tests/ -v
▸ Lint:     uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check .
▸ Build:    uv build
▸ Install:  uv tool install odoo-fast-report-mapper-equitania
▸ Upgrade:  uv tool upgrade odoo-fast-report-mapper-equitania
